{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周二（3日）漸轉多雲，早晚有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>市區最低氣溫約26°C，新界再低一兩度。</p><p>日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約29°C。</p><p>吹微風，轉吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，離岸間中吹強風。</p><p>周三（4日）風勢仍然較大。</p><p>周四（5日）部分時間有陽光。</p><p>周五（6日）風勢逐漸增強，周末期間吹偏東強風。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:16.659880+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:51:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.045769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:21.739446+00:00","content_hash":"f00b2e9e368cd7d2b93e7e127c134c37accb17e5b4f280f4afbe42f142f5aca1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}